WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.925
Tear film assessment in five minutes.

2
00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:08.541
A quick, repeatable clinic routine for tear break-up time, staining and symptom scoring.

3
00:00:08.991 --> 00:00:15.829
Most patients have evaporative disease linked to meibomian gland dysfunction, aqueous deficiency or a mix of both.

4
00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:23.187
Treatment moves from environmental advice and lubricants to lid care, anti-inflammatory drops and in-office procedures.

5
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:27.039
Prolonged screen use reduces blink rate and completeness.

6
00:00:27.489 --> 00:00:29.788
Regular breaks and screen position help.
